      "content": "that's a lot to work with. i really want to lean into that contrast you mentioned—the \"civilized\" vs \"savage\" thing. can you give me some ideas for how their social structure or \"law\" would work compared to the protagonists? like, if the protagonists have organized cities and laws, what would this group's version of justice or leadership look like to make them feel more unpredictable and less \"enlightened\"?",
